From: Tony Wen <jwen2914@uni.sydney.edu.au>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 09:12:14 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] [Spec Decode] Add reload_draft_weights to hot-swap an updated
 draft model

Reload the speculative draft model's weights in place from a new
checkpoint through a worker RPC, so a drafter trained online can be
swapped into a running engine without a restart. Submodules the draft
shares with the target (EAGLE embedding, MTP lm_head) are detached while
the checkpoint loads so target storage is never written.

Co-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Tony Wen <jwen2914@uni.sydney.edu.au>
